{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>幼稚園老師雲嫦娥在TVB節目《唱錢》鼓起極大勇氣，再度挑戰被網民封為「地獄級神曲」的《Show you》！賽前已「未唱先驚」的她，上台後緊張狀態一發不可收拾，被系統的「WARNING」警號瘋狂追殺，情急之下竟使出「閉眼式演唱法」自救，畫面既驚險又令人心痛！</p><p>雲嫦娥未唱先驚：「首歌好似過山車」</p><p>雲嫦娥上回挑戰《Show you》時，已因過度緊張導致音準出現大幅波動，音樂系統上顯示大量「紅Bar」。今次重返《唱錢》舞台，她坦言依然恐懼：「都怕嘅。」更透露自己的準備方式只是簡單地上網重溫、跟著原唱練習，並形容這首歌的難度：「呢隻歌好似過山車。」可見她對這次挑戰充滿憂慮。</p><p>挑戰地獄級神曲《Show you》</p><p>被網民視為「地獄級神曲」的《Show you》，對演唱者要求極高。歌曲的高低音跨度極大，而且節奏和音節非常緊湊，即使是專業歌手也未必能輕易駕馭。雲嫦娥作為素人參賽者，要挑戰如此高難度的歌曲，其心理壓力可想而知，也讓觀眾對她的表現充滿好奇與擔憂。</p><p>緊張大爆發創「閉眼式演唱法」自救</p><p>正式演唱時，雲嫦娥的緊張狀態完全爆發。她開唱不久，音樂系統已再度顯示多個「紅Bar」，更被「WARNING」警號瘋狂追殺，情況岌岌可危。在極度緊張之下，她突然使出獨門招式「閉眼式演唱法」，全程緊閉雙眼試圖緩和緊張情緒，集中精神演唱。這個意想不到的舉動，讓現場所有人都為她捏了一把冷汗，氣氛緊張到極點。</p><p>網民勁心痛：「睇到我都好緊張！」</p><p>雲嫦娥的表現引起網民極大迴響，不少人表示心痛和佩服：「佢真係好勇敢，呢首歌職業歌手都未必搞得掂！」、「閉眼唱歌嗰下好心酸，完全感受到佢有幾驚！」、「睇到我個心都離一離，好想衝入去攬住佢！」、「幼稚園老師加油！勇氣可嘉，已經贏咗自己！」、「呢個節目真係好恐怖，睇見都覺得大壓力！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_16703870336a8fc589b3ba3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_10665355646a8fc58c92e90.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_14613993086a8fc596b5891.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04a_16898774186a8fc59b0a91e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_2925180146a8fc5a107228.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_7514158686a8fc5a4d4e9f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_10904091116a8fc5a7c73c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_15696684416a8fc5aad773a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_13028681926a8fc5ae5b39f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_4113610676a8fc5b28cc53.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_12443099256a8fc5b6bf59e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_19627248326a8fc5ba047bc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_3140655656a8fc5bfcc9c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_1320968416a8fc5c3ad866.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_1777089456a8fc5c705231.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_10728386596a8fc5ca2aef1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_16707632686a8fc5ce883f8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_7754104726a8fc5d1c7566.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_5960832266a8fc5d50038f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_624068066a8fc5d97837b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_5552917456a8fc5dfb1964.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_11633212626a8fc5e293f04.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_8281722056a8fc5e76ebe4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_8951361156a8fc5ea97996.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_13450112436a8fc5ed9ca2f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_14815827636a8fc5f0e2746.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_5469868516a8fc5f475426.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T05:19:02.092416+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1019,"images":27,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}